---
const effectiveDate = "August 1, 2026";
---

<section class="legal-page privacy-policy-page">
  <p class="eyebrow">Privacy policy</p>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="legal-updated">Purpose Driven Consulting, LLC · Effective Date: {effectiveDate}</p>

  <p>
    Purpose Driven Consulting, LLC ("Purpose Driven Consulting," "we," "our," or "us") respects your privacy and is committed to protecting the personal information you share with us. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit our website, use our applications, or interact with our services, including applications that utilize Meta (Facebook) Login.
  </p>
  <p>By using our website or applications, you consent to the practices described in this Privacy Policy.</p>

  <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
  <p>We may collect information including:</p>

  <h3>Information You Provide</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Name</li>
    <li>Email address</li>
    <li>Telephone number</li>
    <li>Company name</li>
    <li>Job title</li>
    <li>Information submitted through contact forms</li>
    <li>Coaching or consulting inquiries</li>
    <li>Workshop registration information</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Information Received from Meta (Facebook)</h3>
  <p>If you choose to log in using Facebook Login, we may receive information that you authorize Meta to share, including:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Public profile</li>
    <li>Name</li>
    <li>Email address</li>
    <li>Profile picture, if authorized</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We only access information that you expressly authorize.</p>

  <h3>Automatically Collected Information</h3>
  <p>We may automatically collect:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>IP address</li>
    <li>Browser type</li>
    <li>Device information</li>
    <li>Operating system</li>
    <li>Referring website</li>
    <li>Pages visited</li>
    <li>Date and time of access</li>
    <li>Cookies and similar technologies</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
  <p>We use your information to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Provide coaching, consulting, and leadership development services.</li>
    <li>Manage user accounts.</li>
    <li>Authenticate users through Meta Login.</li>
    <li>Communicate regarding services, events, and workshops.</li>
    <li>Improve our website and applications.</li>
    <li>Respond to customer inquiries.</li>
    <li>Maintain security and prevent fraud.</li>
    <li>Comply with legal obligations.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Information Sharing</h2>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information.</p>
  <p>We may share information with:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Service providers who assist us in operating our business.</li>
    <li>Technology providers that host our applications.</li>
    <li>Payment processors, when applicable.</li>
    <li>Government authorities when required by law.</li>
    <li>Successors in the event of a merger, acquisition, or sale of business assets.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Data Security</h2>
  <p>We maintain reasonable administrative, technical, and physical safeguards designed to protect personal information against unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, or destruction.</p>
  <p>While we strive to protect your information, no method of electronic transmission or storage is completely secure.</p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>Our website may use cookies and similar technologies to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Improve user experience</li>
    <li>Analyze website traffic</li>
    <li>Remember user preferences</li>
    <li>Support authentication</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Users may disable cookies through their browser settings; however, some website features may not function properly.</p>

  <h2>Data Retention</h2>
  <p>We retain personal information only for as long as necessary to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Provide requested services</li>
    <li>Fulfill contractual obligations</li>
    <li>Comply with legal requirements</li>
    <li>Resolve disputes</li>
    <li>Enforce agreements</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Your Rights</h2>
  <p>Depending on your location, you may have the right to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Access your personal information</li>
    <li>Correct inaccurate information</li>
    <li>Request deletion of personal information</li>
    <li>Restrict certain processing</li>
    <li>Object to certain processing</li>
    <li>Request a copy of your data</li>
  </ul>
  <p>To exercise these rights, please contact us using the information below.</p>

  <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
  <p>Our services are not directed to children under the age of 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>

  <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
  <p>Our website and applications may contain links to third-party websites or integrate third-party services, including Meta Platforms, Inc. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those third parties.</p>

  <h2>Changes to this Policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. Updates will be posted on this page with a revised Effective Date.</p>

  <h2>Contact Us</h2>
  <p>
    Purpose Driven Consulting, LLC<br />
    Website: <a href="https://www.purpose-drivenconsulting.net">https://www.purpose-drivenconsulting.net</a><br />
    Email: <a href="mailto:john@purpose-drivenconsulting.net">john@purpose-drivenconsulting.net</a><br />
    Phone: (928) 273-8939
  </p>
  <p>If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us using the information above.</p>

  <hr />

  <h2>User Data Deletion Instructions</h2>
  <p class="legal-subtitle">Purpose Driven Consulting, LLC · User Data Deletion Policy</p>
  <p>Purpose Driven Consulting respects your right to control your personal information.</p>
  <p>If you have used Facebook Login or otherwise provided personal information to our website or applications, you may request deletion of your personal information at any time.</p>

  <h3>How to Request Deletion</h3>
  <p>To request deletion of your personal data, email <a href="mailto:john@purpose-drivenconsulting.net">john@purpose-drivenconsulting.net</a> with the subject line <strong>Data Deletion Request</strong>.</p>
  <p>Please include:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Your full name</li>
    <li>Email address associated with your account</li>
    <li>A brief description of your request</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>What Happens Next</h3>
  <p>After verifying your identity, we will:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Delete personal information that is no longer required for legal or business purposes.</li>
    <li>Remove Facebook Login information associated with your account.</li>
    <li>Delete application data where permitted by law.</li>
    <li>Notify you when the deletion process has been completed.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Most requests are completed within 30 days.</p>
  <p>Certain records may be retained when required by law, contractual obligations, fraud prevention, or legitimate business purposes.</p>

  <h3>Facebook Login Users</h3>
  <p>If you have authenticated using Facebook Login, you may also remove our application's access directly from your Facebook account:</p>
  <p><strong>Facebook → Settings &amp; Privacy → Settings → Apps and Websites → Remove Purpose Driven Consulting</strong></p>
  <p>Removing the application from Facebook revokes future access. If you also wish for us to delete information already stored by Purpose Driven Consulting, please submit the email request described above.</p>

  <h3>Contact</h3>
  <p>
    Purpose Driven Consulting, LLC<br />
    Email: <a href="mailto:john@purpose-drivenconsulting.net">john@purpose-drivenconsulting.net</a><br />
    Website: <a href="https://www.purpose-drivenconsulting.net">https://www.purpose-drivenconsulting.net</a>
  </p>
</section>

